  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the backstage corridor of Studio Four, star host Wen Simo and chief producer Chun Yuqiao meet face to face for the first time and spar politely over management style and past rumours. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "初次见面啊，淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻先生，这里是幕后。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "不欢迎我这个抛头露面的人啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有何指教？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "不敢当，你是金牌制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "制片人和导演我合作过很多，有一句话还是要奉劝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "其实你没必要对你的下属太过于严苛，尤其是当着外国人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻老师，我行事有自己的分寸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "无论在什么样的人面前，我也只是在做自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这就是当初你离开以前卫视的原因吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我当初离开卫视的原因是女人，你知道的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "初次见面啊，淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our very first meeting, Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻先生，这里是幕后。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen Simo, this is the backstage area.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "不欢迎我这个抛头露面的人啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is an on-camera face like mine not welcome back here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有何指教？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What advice do you have for me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "不敢当，你是金牌制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You flatter me—you are a gold-medal producer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "制片人和导演我合作过很多，有一句话还是要奉劝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have worked with many producers and directors, yet allow me one word of friendly advice.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "其实你没必要对你的下属太过于严苛，尤其是当着外国人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is really no need to be so harsh on your staff, especially in front of foreign guests.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻老师，我行事有自己的分寸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen Simo, I have my own sense of measure in how I act.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "无论在什么样的人面前，我也只是在做自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter who is standing in front of me, I am simply being myself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这就是当初你离开以前卫视的原因吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was that temperament the reason you left your previous network back then?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我当初离开卫视的原因是女人，你知道的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The reason I left that network back then was a woman, as you know.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
